nd"], "long_description": "Welcome to Blackjack Bailey, the most entertaining seat in the casino! Slip on your headset and step into a stunning VR casino where the cards are hot, the stakes are high, and Bailey\u2014your quick-witted dealer\u2014is ready to keep you on your toes.\n\nBailey isn\u2019t just another dealer. She reacts to your wins, losses, and risky moves with clever commentary and lively expressions, making every round feel unique. Whether she\u2019s teasing your strategy, celebrating your victories, or raising an eyebrow at your choices, Bailey ensures no two games ever play the same.\n\nWith smooth, intuitive controls, classic Blackjack rules, and a fully immersive casino atmosphere, Blackjack Bailey captures the excitement of the real thing without ever leaving home. Perfect your strategy, test your nerve, and see how long you can stay ahead of the house.\n\nThink you\u2019ve got what it takes to dominate the tables? Climb the global leaderboard, compare your skills with players around the world, and prove you\u2019re more than just lucky\u2014you\u2019re the best.\n\nIt\u2019s you, the cards, and Bailey. She\u2019s sharp, she\u2019s sassy, and she\u2019s ready to deal. Are you ready to play?", "short_description": "Step into a stunning VR casino and take on Bailey, your quick-witted dealer, in a game of classic Blackjack. Bailey\u2019s lively reactions and memorable quotes make every hand unique, keeping you entertained as you play. Test your skills, refine your strategy, and climb the global leaderboard to prove you\u2019re the best at the table. Are you ready to beat Bailey and outplay the competition?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hologramsoft.com/Privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hologram Software LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hologramsoft.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context